धन्यवाद।

body.en:
My name is {{name}} and I hold a savings account in your branch with account number {{account_no}}.
I have a problem with the following transaction in my account: {{txn_details}}
The problem is as follows: {{problem}}
I therefore request you to kindly look into the matter and arrange a prompt resolution as per the applicable rules. My mobile number for contact is {{mobile}}.
Thank you.
